  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Horizons &#x2013; Strengthening Elections and Peace in Somaliland is a timely response to Somaliland&#x2019;s political landscape challenges. The project proposes a locally rooted, conflict-sensitive approach to advancing inclusive governance, electoral transparency, and grassroots peacebuilding. It aligns with Somaliland&#x2019;s priorities and builds on momentum generated by earlier interventions. The main objective of the project is Increased short-to-medium term political stability through peaceful political settlements and reconciliation</narrative>
